  "details": "I've had this happen to me multiple times where I thought I had accepted someone's request to join but turns out it didn't actually go through and I was unaware until I checked the notifications tab again. \nIf you start moving as soon as you click the accept/deny button and while the notification is starting to close, it cancels out sending the inv to the other person. It should be the case where no matter what, as soon as you hit the 'accept req inv' button, the API sends the inv over to the other person. That and the notification should disappear completely as well after said request was accepted/denied.\n\nEDIT: Apparently doing any action at all that closes the menu normally also cancels it out.\n\nVideo: https://streamable.com/r2ej7h",
